[19.431, "o", "\r\n"]
[21.231, "o", "\r\n"]
[21.781, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Got it — keeping the name `vm-01`.\r\n"]
[22.781, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Important find before I wipe anything: vm-01 runs a scheduled S3 backup\r\n"]
[23.681, "o", "  (`~/scripts/homelab-backup.sh` + its key). Preserving that first.\r\n"]
[24.881, "o", "\r\n"]
[25.431, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mBash  scp -p vm-01:~/scripts/homelab-backup.sh ./salvage/\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[26.131, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Salvaging…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(12s · ↓ 0.8k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[28.131, "o", "\r\n"]
[28.681, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Now writing the vm-01 config, then checking it evaluates.\r\n"]
[29.681, "o", "\r\n"]
[30.231, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mBash  nix eval .#nixosConfigurations.vm-01.config.system.build.toplevel\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[30.931, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Evaluating…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(41s · ↓ 2.6k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[32.931, "o", "\r\n"]
[33.481, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Config evaluates cleanly. Committing to the repo.\r\n"]
[34.581, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Now the kexec phase — this is the point of no return for vm-01's\r\n"]
[35.481, "o", "  Debian install.\r\n"]
[36.681, "o", "\r\n"]
[37.231, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mBash  nixos-anywhere --flake .#vm-01 root@vm-01\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[37.931, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Installing…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(1m 04s · ↓ 3.4k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.931, "o", "\r\n"]
[40.481, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Kexec was rejected: Secure Boot is enabled on this VM, so the kernel\r\n"]
[41.381, "o", "  refuses to load the unsigned NixOS kernel. Checking how boxed-in we are.\r\n"]
[42.581, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Investigating…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(27s · ↓ 1.9k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[44.581, "o", "\r\n"]
[45.131, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Blocked on a real fork. vm-01 is a Gen-2 VM with Secure Boot On, and the\r\n"]
[46.031, "o", "  kernel is in `integrity` lockdown — that blocks both kexec paths, so the\r\n"]
[46.931, "o", "  install can't start. NixOS also can't Secure Boot without lanzaboote.\r\n"]
[48.231, "o", "\r\n"]
[48.781, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220m\u001b[1mI can disable Secure Boot from the hypervisor and power-cycle it.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[49.681, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220mThat reboots vm-01. Say go and I'll do it.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[50.281, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mwaiting for you…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[53.481, "o", "\r\n"]
[54.031, "o", "\u001b[38;5;37m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── nixos-vm-01\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[54.531, "o", "\u001b[38;5;114m❯\u001b[0m "]
[55.231, "o", "\u001b"]
[55.312, "o", "["]
[55.4, "o", "3"]
[55.492, "o", "8"]
[55.541, "o", ";"]
[55.649, "o", "5"]
[55.749, "o", ";"]
[55.855, "o", "2"]
[55.956, "o", "5"]
[56.028, "o", "3"]
[56.101, "o", "m"]
[56.153, "o", "g"]
[56.243, "o", "o"]
[56.292, "o", " "]
[56.342, "o", "a"]
[56.401, "o", "h"]
[56.458, "o", "e"]
[56.527, "o", "a"]
[56.575, "o", "d"]
[56.62, "o", "\u001b"]
[56.676, "o", "["]
[56.728, "o", "0"]
[56.798, "o", "m"]
[56.845, "o", "\r\n"]
[58.645, "o", "\r\n"]
[59.195, "o", "\r\n"]
[59.745, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mBash  ssh hv-01 powershell -c \"Set-VMFirmware vm-01 -EnableSecureBoot Off\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[60.445, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Reconfiguring…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(34s · ↓ 1.1k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[62.445, "o", "\r\n"]
[62.995, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Lockdown is now `[none]` — kexec will work. Re-running.\r\n"]
[63.995, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Installing…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(2m 11s · ↓ 4.2k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[65.995, "o", "\r\n"]
[66.545, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Mid-kexec, host unreachable as expected. But it never came back.\r\n"]
[67.645, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m I have hypervisor access, so let me grab the VM console screen directly.\r\n"]
[68.645, "o", "\r\n"]
[69.195, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mBash  ssh hv-01 powershell -c \"Get-VMConsole vm-01 | Out-File screen.txt\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[69.895, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Capturing…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(19s · ↓ 1.5k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[71.895, "o", "\r\n"]
[72.445, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Found it — the console shows the kexec kernel booted but\r\n"]
[73.345, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220mInitramfs unpacking failed: XZ-compressed data is corrupt\u001b[0m, then hung.\r\n"]
[74.245, "o", "  That's the classic symptom of too little RAM to unpack the ~430 MB\r\n"]
[75.145, "o", "  installer initrd. vm-01 has 4 GB. Bumping it temporarily to 8 GB.\r\n"]
[76.345, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Retrying…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(3m 48s · ↓ 5.7k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[78.345, "o", "\r\n"]
[78.895, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Host is answering — connection refused, not unreachable. It's booting,\r\n"]
[79.795, "o", "  sshd not up yet.\r\n"]
[80.895, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;114mvm-01 is up on NixOS 26.11\u001b[0m, booted from disk, both NICs and the IPv6\r\n"]
[81.795, "o", "  address correct. Two things to check — DNS is failing.\r\n"]
[82.995, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Found the real issue: private names fail while public names work.\r\n"]
[83.895, "o", "  systemd-resolved is routing queries to its fallback instead of the local\r\n"]
[84.795, "o", "  resolver, because nothing marks the interface's DNS as authoritative.\r\n"]
[85.795, "o", "  Fixing that in the config, not by hand on the box.\r\n"]
[86.995, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Rebuilding…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(58s · ↓ 2.2k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[88.995, "o", "\r\n"]
[89.545, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Now restoring the VM to its original 4 GB and doing a cold boot — the\r\n"]
[90.445, "o", "  real test that it comes up unattended.\r\n"]
[91.645, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Verifying…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(1m 27s · ↓ 3.0k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[93.645, "o", "\r\n"]
[94.195, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;114mEverything verified.\u001b[0m vm-01 runs NixOS 26.11, converted entirely over\r\n"]
[95.095, "o", "  SSH. Disk layout, both NICs, IPv6, DNS and the cluster agent all check out\r\n"]
[95.995, "o", "  after a cold boot at the original 4 GB. Config committed and pushed.\r\n"]
[97.395, "o", "\r\n"]
[97.945, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246m8 of 9 nodes converted.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
